<title>USA: JP Morgan wins San Francisco Airports $131 mln.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan wins San Francisco Airports $131 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said it won $131 million of Airports Commission of the city and county of San FRancisco, Calif., International Airport second series revenue bonds, issue 13A, taxable, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 7.2604 percent.</p>
</text>
